<% content_for :title, 'Request account deletion' %>

<style>
  p, h2, h3, ol {
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }
  a {
    color: blue;
  }
  ol {
    list-style-type: decimal;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>

<p>
  You can delete your Skribl account and associated data using either
  of the following methods.
</p>

<h2>If you can sign in to Skribl</h2>

<p>You can delete your account immediately from within the app:</p>

<ol>
  <li>Sign in to Skribl.</li>
  <li>From the home page, select <strong>Account</strong>.</li>
  <li>
    Press the <strong>Delete Account</strong> button and follow the
    instructions.
  </li>
</ol>

<img src="<%= asset_path 'delete-account/account-cropped.jpg' %>" alt="Account">

<p>
  Your account and associated data will be deleted immediately without
  needing to send an email request.
</p>

<h2>If you cannot sign in to Skribl</h2>

<p>
  To request account deletion, email
  <a href="mailto:hello@matthewblott.com">hello@matthewblott.com</a>
  from the email address associated with your account.
</p>

<p>
  Please use <strong>Account deletion request</strong> as the subject line.
  Your request will be actioned within 30 days. We may contact you to
  verify your identity before proceeding.
</p>

<p>
  Account deletion is permanent. Your account and associated data will
  be deleted, subject to any data we are legally required to retain.
</p>

